---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn more about James Hawley - CS & Economics student at the University of Virginia."
>
  <article class="about">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      I'm James, a Computer Science and Economics double major at the
      University of Virginia, based out of Orlando, Florida.
    </p>

    <p>
      I have three years of experience at <strong>Lockheed Martin</strong>,
      where I gained hands-on experience in defense technology and systems
      engineering. This site is where I explore the intersection of technology
      and markets, document my projects, and share what I'm learning along the
      way.
    </p>

    <h2>What I Write About</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Technology</strong> — Software, programming languages, and the tech industry.
      <strong>Economics</strong> — Markets, policy, and how technology reshapes economic models.
      <strong>Books</strong> — Reviews and notes on what I'm reading.
      <strong>Projects</strong> — Technical write-ups from concept to deployment.
    </p>

    <h2>Background</h2>

    <p>
      I'm pursuing both Computer Science and Economics at UVA because I
      believe the most interesting problems exist at the intersection of
      disciplines. Technology is reshaping every aspect of the economy, and
      understanding both dimensions gives a more complete picture.
    </p>

    <p>
      My experience at Lockheed Martin gave me a unique perspective on
      large-scale High Performance Computing systems, project management, and
      the real-world implications of engineering decisions. I'm channeling
      that experience into my studies and the projects I build.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>

    <p>
      If something I've written resonates with you, or if you'd like to
      discuss opportunities, I'd love to hear from you:
      <a href="mailto:jameshawley@email.virginia.edu">Email</a>,
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/james-m-hawley/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>,
      <a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .about h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .about p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .about a:hover {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .about strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
    }
  }
</style>
